  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 302, 'Grip the pole on the train with one hand rather than leaning your whole body on it, so others can hold it too.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 303, 'Fill your bottle quickly at the gym water fountain and step aside so the line keeps moving.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 304, 'Lower the blinds in the shared lounge on a hot summer afternoon, so the room stays cool for everyone.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 305, 'Look for a repair cafe or skill swap in your town, and bring one item to fix.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 306, 'Offer to share a bench or picnic table with someone who is looking for a seat.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 307, 'Close your bus window if the rain starts blowing in, so the seats stay dry for the next riders.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 308, 'Switch off the light and fan in an empty study room as you leave.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 309, 'Straighten your doormat so it sits in front of your own door, not out in the shared hallway.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 310, 'Pass along a winter coat you no longer wear to a coat drive at your library or community center.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 311, 'Pack out your orange peel or apple core instead of tossing it into the bushes, since it takes longer to break down than people think.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 312, 'Set a neighbor''s trash bin upright if the wind has knocked it over onto your shared sidewalk.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 313, 'Carry the library''s step stool back to its corner after you reach a high shelf.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 314, 'Fluff the cushions and gather the cups in your building''s shared lounge before you leave.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 315, 'Rest in the reading room of your library and think about all the people who have used that same chair.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 316, 'Bring a small folding seat to a crowded summer festival in the park, leaving the benches for those who need them most.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 317, 'Switch on captions and mute your phone when you watch a clip on the bus without headphones.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 318, 'Set the community center''s heat or air conditioning back to its usual setting when your meeting ends.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 319, 'Check your pockets for tissues and pens before you wash, so the shared machine stays clean for the next load.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 320, 'Learn the name of the creek, river or lake your storm drains flow to, and keep that water in mind.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 321, 'Rinse the sand off your feet quickly at the beach shower, so the next person can use it.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 322, 'Let a fellow rider know if they dropped a glove or ticket, and hand it back with a smile.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 323, 'Stack the folding chairs neatly after an event at a library or community hall.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 324, 'Ask your coworkers what would make the break room nicer, and pick one small idea to try.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 325, 'Read a picture book about neighborhoods with a child, and talk about a place you both share.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 326, 'Teach a child you know how to use a litter grabber, and let them choose which wrappers to collect.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 327, 'Carry skis, a big suitcase or a bike upright and close to you on the train, so the aisle stays open.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 328, 'Drop a canned good into the food drive box at your library or community center this fall.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 329, 'Thank the mail carrier or delivery driver who brings packages to your building.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 330, 'Help with the late summer harvest at a community garden that invites volunteers.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 331, 'Thank a fellow walker you see picking up litter, with a simple "thank you for doing that."'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 332, 'Ask your city council office whether your bus stop could use a bench or a shade tree.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 333, 'Play the public piano at a library or station gently and briefly, then leave the bench free for the next player.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 334, 'Walk quietly past classrooms when you visit your child''s school during lessons.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 335, 'Join a neighborhood walk or tour led by a local history group.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 336, 'Move aside at a busy park viewpoint once you have your photo, so the next person gets a turn.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 337, 'Teach a child in your life to wait for riders to step off before stepping onto the bus.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 338, 'Tuck your gym bag against the wall, not in the walkway between machines.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 339, 'Offer your leftover moving boxes to a neighbor who is moving in, rather than leaving them in the trash room.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 340, 'Organize a small book swap with friends or coworkers, and give the leftovers to a little free library.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 341, 'Rinse and return any borrowed cleanup gloves or grabbers to the organizer at the end of an event.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 342, 'Mention a missing curb ramp to your city''s service line, so people using wheelchairs can get around.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 343, 'Lower the weights gently to the floor instead of dropping them, so the room stays calm.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 344, 'Ask the others in a shared lounge before you change the music or TV channel.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 345, 'Look at an old photo of your town''s main street or park and notice what has stayed loved over the years.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 346, 'Enjoy the ducks and geese from the path this fall without tossing them bread, so they keep eating their own food.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 347, 'Ride the bus with patience at rush hour, giving people the benefit of the doubt when they bump you.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 348, 'Weigh down your napkins at an outdoor cafe table on a breezy summer afternoon, so they do not blow into the street.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 349, 'Hang your bike on its hook in the building''s bike room, not leaning across other people''s bikes.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 350, 'Give a small donation to a park conservancy or library friends group, if it fits your budget.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 351, 'Offer your extra sunscreen or bug spray to someone at the park who forgot theirs, if they would like some.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 352, 'Wave hello to a neighbor raking or shoveling on your block, and offer to lend a hand for a few minutes.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 353, 'Bring a reusable cup to the cafe this morning so there is one less cup in the bin.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 354, 'Clean up quickly if a bag leaks in the elevator, and let the super know if it needs a mop.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 355, 'Ask a gardener at the community garden to show you one plant they are proud of.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 356, 'Slide a picnic table or movable chair back to its usual spot when you leave the park.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 357, 'Leave a little extra time for your commute this evening, so you can move calmly and kindly through the crowd.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 358, 'Arrive a few minutes early for a fitness class at the rec center, so you can set up without crowding others.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 359, 'Share the laundry room kindly on a busy weekend by using one machine at a time when others are waiting.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 360, 'Choose one shared place to visit more often, and put your next visit on your calendar.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 361, 'Choose one park habit from this year you want to keep, like closing gates or packing out, and tell a friend about it.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 362, 'Picture the sidewalk outside your door through the eyes of someone using a cane, and clear one thing that might get in their way.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 363, 'Glance back once before you leave any public building today and check that you took everything you brought.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 364, 'Choose one shared space at work or school before you head home and leave one thing in it neater.'),
  ('caring-for-shared-spaces', 365, 'End the day by writing one sentence about a shared place you helped or noticed, and how it felt.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
